; RP1 Ethernet TCP/IP interface configuration (DHCP)
HKLM,"SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\Tcpip\Parameters\Interfaces\{2E5F3B71-5C8D-4D7A-9E1B-52B4EC271201}","EnableDHCP",0x00010001,0x00000001
